          "section": "2.1. Fabrication",
          "quote": "An Arcam Q10 + EBM machine was utilized for all printing. A pure tungsten base plate was used, 100 mm in diameter and 10 mm thick, obtained from refractory supplier Rembar . A reduced volume custom build chamber was used to reach extremely high preheat build temperatures. ...  The surface temperature was estimated using a Fluke Process Instruments two color pyrometer to be 1800 ◦ C . The accelerating voltage was always fixed at 60 kV .",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
